{"id":"divin","lemma":"divin","pos":"adj","rank":2869,"glosses":["divine, godlike (of or pertaining to a god)","divine, exquisite"],"ipa":"/di.vɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/23/Fr-divin.ogg/Fr-divin.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"divine","masculinePlural":"divins","femininePlural":"divines"},"formAudio":{"divine":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Le_Commissaire-divine.wav","divins":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-divins.wav","divines":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-divines.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ce repas était simplement divin.","en":"That meal was simply divine.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"meal, repast"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"simply"},null]},{"text":"Ce fut une intervention divine.","en":"It was a divine intervention.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"intervention"},null]},{"text":"Se tromper est humain, pardonner, divin.","en":"To err is human, to forgive divine.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to trick, dupe"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"human"},{"g":"to pardon, forgive"},null]},{"text":"Ça a été une intervention divine.","en":"It was a divine intervention.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"intervention"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"was everything OK?"]]},{"text":"Il prétend avoir des visions divines.","en":"He claims to have visions from God.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to claim, to allege","l":"prétendre"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"vision, sight","l":"vision"},null]}]}